{"version":1,"content":"<p>林寶堅尼早前為車迷，帶來新世代「細牛」Temerario開篷版車型--Temerario Spyder。</p><p>其最大特色莫過於採用了全新開篷技術，那就是可伸縮的電動硬頂，屬該品牌史上首見。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;該系統的核心屬</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.057595+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:00:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_hash":"ac485415e968a20d55fb6419591ac6653db15f47abb05b372ab6fe0534d49e2c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}